Z||000008||Indiana_resto_guy||10-30-2001||11:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by EdsB52:<BR><B>Just like last time we had the blow up, Cliff alienates objectivity, ignores the fact that many people are voluntarily engaging in disputes, and makes me the scapegoat. Why Cliff, is it just easier that way? Last time you not only allowed the cowards to cast idle threats, you lead the cheer; do you call that objectivity? <P>So Cliff, do what you want with this and I don't care that you closed the thread, but for the sake of your dignity try not to resort to a call for the cheerleaders to unite.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>EdsB52,<P><BR>Normally I try to stay out of these threads.<BR>In this case I will not, a poor choice of words you have used this time.<P>Objectivity: Uninfluenced by emotions or personal prejudices.<P>All over the CLOSED THREAD, you indicated a personal opinion which is generated by your own beliefs and feelings (emotions) and voiced your own opinion caused by them which strongly contains personal prejudices.<BR>Re-examine the words you use as you are not as you present yourself to others!<BR>The rest of your [QUOTED] material which i removed is a lame attempt of justification of selfesteem by attempting to use the freedom of speach, freedom of religion and attempt to bring into play using my rules and no one elses. For those who are unaware where this came from the definition of acquiescence is as follows:<P>To consent or comply without protest.<P>Ed, you do in fact have a right to your opinion AS DO THE REST OF US! Please don't make the attempt to shove your opinion down our throats without protest!<BR>Pat of omission of [QUOTE}: Hey, if I'm going to correspond with a bunch of halfwits, I might as well have fun. <BR>Not all of us are in your class of 'halfwits'. You must hangout with a lot of those persons so you may feel superior to them. With the examples that you show here, you must have nothing better to do!<BR>Call up some friends (if you have those) and get drunk or something!<BR>{QUOTE}: Without mentioning names, there are a few members that can carry their own in an argument, the rest just angrily spout off.<P>Which are YOU?<BR>||||reg||1
