Z||000044||JSocha||10-30-2001||06:11 PM||||THANK YOU!  THERE IS A GOD AND HIS NAME IS CLIFF!<P>I'm posting this from a laptop as my computer here in my office is down with a hard drive upgrade, so I missed a majority of what happened.<P>Does this means that I don't have to worry about getting false teeth any time soon, as I have been clenching my teeth hard lately not to get into it with...ahhhhh...what was his name again...you know the one who finally got booted off the proverbial Island?  Or has he in fact been the one on the Island all by himself when he said I was?!<P>Anyways...<P>I've been staying off the forum as much as possible lately, not only because I have been busy at work, but also, because I just knew I would get into it with him again.<P>The Rate the GF thread, it took alot of personal restraint for me so as not to add my 2 cents as I wanted to.  Cliff locked the thread before I could say my 2 cents.<P>And at least my email will not be swamped, as I won't be getting into it with him anymore.<P>JohnnyK, Ed perpetuated his own demise and overall lack of popularity here.  Many have crossed the lines with others in the past and have elected to apoligize and/or make amends and still have a friend in the end.  Ed constantly attempted to justify himself.  Even Ted Bundy, a persuasive talker, couldn't talk himself out of his execution.  You do not compare and have not compared to him by your posts.<P>His behavior was self destructive.<P>Cliff, thanks again...it was about time, not from my point of view, but from the forums and for the forums sake.  <P>I'm not attempting to add fuel to any fire...I do feel however, based on past emails others have shared when I stood up to him, that overtime, others who have been afraid to share their opinions in OT after Ed had showed up for no constructive reason, will once again feel comfortable here and be willing to post freely, versus having the fear of being demoralized, ostrasized and the like by Ed as has been the case in the past.<P>Sorry so long winded...<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
