Z||000052||My7Fieros||10-30-2001||10:12 PM||||You know Ive been thinking about this for a while...Im convinced that Ed was/is being taught in his "lawyer school" to do something of this sorts...to find a group, online or not (but safer for his sake to be online), start a debate, cause a commotion, bascially be the "bad guy" (which he is, or rather, <I>was</I>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ), therefore allowing himself "training" of sorts to be a grade a number one a$$. Not only that, but to <I>try</I> to defend his rediculas actions and comments, the way a good p.o.s. atturney would do.<BR>He's a serious pain in the a$$, no doubt. So much so that I (tried) to stay off the Forum for the past month. (Although I have to admit I didnt...I made up another user name, Im sure somebody will figure out my "alter ego" on here someday  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ).<BR>Believe me, if Ed comes back on here under a different name, and believe me, he will, it will be painfully obvious its him. Eds whole m.o. is his long dragged out posts; complete with breakdowns of every sentence somebody says in their posts.....you'll know it when its him, Im sure. I know I, for one, feel MUCH better about this forum. Just like Cliff said, he rarely, if ever, posted anything Fiero related...always in O/T, and even then rarely were they his own posts, usually just annoying replies to others. <BR>His "royalty for a day" and "skydiving" threads were complete  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> IMHO. <BR>Go find another forum to piss of Ed, you p.o.s....in fact, head over to the MR2 forum. Nahhhh, even <I>I</I> dont wish the curse of Ed upon anyone. Have a nice life, jerk..........<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My7logo_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
